      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently I believe the fNeedsGpu triggers RunWithGPUTestContexts. This creates tests that are passed in GrContexts which only work with Ganesh. Similarly the RunWithGraphiteTestContexts makes an skgpu::graphite::Context which only works with Graphite. So in the current system those should stay distinct. Now down the line we may come up with a new system that allows for tests that could work on either Graphite or Ganesh. If/When such a thing happens I think we\u0027d add a kGPU TestType here which means any GPU backend works.",
